{"id":"n16223-1-13","stage":2,"title":"갈등 · 矛盾","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16223-1-13-1","ko":"남자 친구와 종교 문제로 갈등이 심하다면서?","zh":"听说你和男朋友因为宗教问题闹得很不愉快？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"남자","meaning":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","explanation":"남자：男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"3","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"친구와","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；와：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"종교","meaning":"宗教","explanation":"종교：宗教","readings":[{"term":"종교","audio":"/audio/51091882576ac7c1da81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62099","senseId":"1","lemma":"종교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"문제로","meaning":"问题","explanation":"문제：问题；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"4","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈등이","meaning":"矛盾，冲突，纠葛","explanation":"갈등：矛盾，冲突，纠葛；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"갈등","audio":"/audio/d1760340752759cd084b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16223","senseId":"1","lemma":"갈등","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"심하다면서?","meaning":"严重","explanation":"심하다：严重；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"심하다","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65046","senseId":"1","lemma":"심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"51091882576ac7c1","term":"종교","zh":"宗教","audio":"/audio/51091882576ac7c1da81.mp3","entryId":"62099","definition":"相信并服从于上帝或超自然控制者的存在，并把这一信仰当作生活及哲学之根本的文化体系。","pronunciation":["종교"]},{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"麻烦的事情或事端。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]},{"id":"d1760340752759cd","term":"갈등","zh":"矛盾，冲突，纠葛","audio":"/audio/d1760340752759cd084b.mp3","entryId":"16223","definition":"彼此想法不同而相互碰撞。","pronunciation":["갈뜽"]},{"id":"a1212e5a4cc18554","term":"심하다","zh":"严重","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3","entryId":"65046","definition":"程度过头。","pronunciation":["심ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c61f8b3ecf9337ade32b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16223-1-13-2","ko":"응, 서로 종교가 다르니까 문제가 자꾸 생기네.","zh":"是啊，因为我们俩的宗教信仰不同，所以问题总是不断出现。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서로","meaning":"互相，相互","explanation":"서로：互相，相互","readings":[{"term":"서로","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66374","senseId":"1","lemma":"서로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"종교가","meaning":"宗教","explanation":"종교：宗教；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"종교","audio":"/audio/51091882576ac7c1da81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62099","senseId":"1","lemma":"종교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다르니까","meaning":"不同，不一致","explanation":"다르다：不同，不一致；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"다르다","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26824","senseId":"1","lemma":"다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"문제가","meaning":"问题","explanation":"문제：问题；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"